Package: cgjrdata
Title: Data for the Country Jobs and Growth Report Dashboard
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ifeanyi", "Edochie", email = "iedochie@worldbank.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Packages the indicators of the World Bank Country Jobs and
    Growth Report (CGJR) institutional framework for the cgjrapp Shiny
    dashboard. A hand-edited crosswalk maps each indicator to a leaf of the
    CGJR taxonomy; the build joins that mapping onto the CLIAR data in
    cliaretl and ships five lazyloaded tables: cgjr_taxonomy, the annotated
    cgjr_crosswalk, cgjr_ctf (Closeness-to-Frontier values, dynamic and
    static, copied unchanged from cliaretl so they match the CLIAR app),
    cgjr_raw (raw source values) and wbcountries (World Bank country
    classifications). Also exports the small functions the build uses to
    check the mapping and reshape the data.
